---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageLogoBg from '../components/PageLogoBg.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy — Vibrum Guitars"
  description="How Vibrum Guitars handles the details you share through the contact and newsletter forms."
>
  <!-- Kept out of search results on purpose — the page exists for people
       who click the link under a form, not as a landing page. -->
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />

  <PageLogoBg />

  <section class="privacy">
    <div class="privacy-inner container">
      <header class="privacy-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
        <h1 class="privacy-title">What we do with your details</h1>
        <p class="privacy-lead">
          The short version: this site sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and
          collects nothing beyond what you type into its two forms.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="privacy-body">
        <h2 class="privacy-h2">What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          The contact form asks for your name, email address, and message. The
          newsletter form asks for your email address. That's everything —
          there is no tracking of any kind on this site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="privacy-h2">How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          Contact messages are used to reply to you, and for nothing else.
          A newsletter address is used to send the workshop letter — a few
          times a year, never more. We never sell or share your details, and
          nobody gets added to the letter without asking for it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="privacy-h2">Who handles it along the way</h2>
        <p>
          Form submissions are delivered to our inbox by
          <a href="https://web3forms.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Web3Forms</a>,
          a form delivery service. They store submissions on their
          infrastructure for a short period before automatic deletion, and
          transfers outside the EEA are covered by the EU Standard Contractual
          Clauses under their data processing agreement. After delivery, your
          message lives in our email — nowhere else.
        </p>

        <h2 class="privacy-h2">Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Every letter includes a way out — or just reply with "unsubscribe"
          and you're off the list. To ask what we hold about you, or to have
          it deleted, write to
          <a href="mailto:info@vibrumguitars.com">info@vibrumguitars.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding-block: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .privacy-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* Same section-label treatment as everywhere else on the site —
     see .label-text in about.astro and .eyebrow in index/gallery/contact. */
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #EDE7D4;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .privacy-lead {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 245, 220, 0.62);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .privacy-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .privacy-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #EDE7D4;
    margin: 34px 0 10px;
  }

  .privacy-body p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 245, 220, 0.55);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .privacy-body a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .privacy-body a:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .privacy-updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: rgba(255, 245, 220, 0.35);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
</style>
